              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "C B-W"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this yesterday then put it in fridge. Only change I made was reducing the sugar to 1/2 T'spoon &amp; adding 1 T of honey. Overnight is did become thicker so do be sure to drizzle in the oil. Today it tasted fine, just too sweet; the next time I'll not add honey or sugar &amp; maybe an extra T of lemon juice.",
